  "The canonicalization amends the lexicon, so its digest — the seed for every draw in the cycle — moves.",
  "Worse than the seed moving: drop_group and shift_group admit on a grouping word appearing in the surface, and canonical rendering takes that pool from 1,549 to 1,399. Even an unchanged seed would draw a different 50.",
  "So the ids themselves are the pin. Seed-pinning survives for B0d alone, whose pool is the eligible set and is grammar-independent."
 ]
